# .checkovignore
# Accepted Checkov findings for stage-2-ecs-fargate/infra/
# Format: CHECK_ID # Justification
#
# Each entry documents WHY the finding is accepted rather than remediated.
# Review this file when findings are resolved upstream.

# CKV_AWS_274: IAM policy uses wildcard resource
# ecr:GetAuthorizationToken is an AWS API that does not support resource-level
# permissions. The token is account-wide by design. This is an AWS constraint,
# not a misconfiguration. Affects: task execution role, GitHub Actions role.
CKV_AWS_274

# CKV_AWS_91: ALB access logging not enabled
# Access logs require a dedicated S3 bucket with a specific bucket policy.
# Out of scope for this development deployment. Enable for production.
CKV_AWS_91

# CKV2_AWS_57: Secrets Manager secret does not have automatic rotation
# The app-config secret holds application configuration values, not credentials
# with a known rotation mechanism (e.g. RDS passwords). Rotation is a manual
# process for this secret type. For database credentials, use an AWS-managed
# rotation Lambda via aws_secretsmanager_secret_rotation.
CKV2_AWS_57

# CKV_AWS_150: ALB deletion protection not enabled
# Deletion protection is appropriate for production load balancers.
# Disabled here to allow clean teardown of development infrastructure via
# tofu destroy without manual intervention.
CKV_AWS_150
